{"title":"Root (disambiguation)","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Root</b> can mean:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Root_(polynomials)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Root (polynomials)\">The root of a polynomial</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Root_(operation)\" title=\"Root (operation)\">Root (operation)</a>, a partial <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inverse\" title=\"Inverse\">inverse</a> to exponentiation.</li></ul>\n<hr />\n<p><i>This is a disambiguation page.  The title you requested could refer to one of the articles listed on this page.</i>\n</p><p>If you were referred to this page through an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere/Root_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Root (disambiguation)\">internal link</a> and you believe that a direct link to a specific article would be more appropriate, feel free to help us out by changing the link on that page.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018105527\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 426/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.426      1 Template:Disambig\n100.00%    6.426      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5848:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018105527 and revision id 20340. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}